gametitle=Guilty Gear XX Accent Core Plus (NTSC-J) [SLPM-66965] (61FE9C13)
comment=US (SLUS-21847) codes, ported by memory map.
comment=Each [section] is a separate cheat: enable only the ones you want.

[Unlock everything]
author=retro-graphics-research
description=Mirrors the game's own debug "all open" routine (reachable only from a leftover debug menu): Kliff, Justice, all EX characters, gold and black colours, GG and GGX modes, Extra Menu, every mission and story ending, complete gallery, and through those every stage the game can unlock (34 in the carousel).
